            "t1": "SPIRIT of the Front Range",
            "t2": "— 05 —",
            "t3": "Recommendations from the team · updated as we go",
            "t4": "A small",
            "t5": "reading list.",
            "t6": "A working list of the books, organizations, tools, places, and practices that have shaped our work — and might shape yours. In the spirit of Stewart Brand",
            "t7": "'",
            "t8": "s old Whole Earth Catalog: an entry only makes it in if it is genuinely useful, in print, and not already common knowledge.",
            "t9": "●",
            "t10": "Catalog",
            "t11": "driftwood · creek edge",
            "t12": "photographed by",
